otaur.\" Below is a brief description. For their appearances, I'll share reference materials via the URL below. ────\n\n✦HO1-White Night 23 years old/APP7/SIZ14 The younger brother of the pair. Quick-witted and polite. Has a laid-back personality. Rarely takes center stage, but cares little about anything besides his brother. Revived his lost brother on his own. ────\n\n✦HO2-Polar Night 25 years old/APP15/SIZ14 The older brother. Tolerant of himself and others, cheerful and often smiling. Behind his lighthearted demeanor lies a strong attachment to his family. Since being revived, he has been less patient with his younger brother. ────\n\nTechnically, they're brothers, but feel free to ignore that. Usage is limited to personal use only, like SNS icons. Thank you for your cooperation🦕🎶 https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G1RN5Fbyy4oz6KNt9BNxEYdvx-78M5VY?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 17612, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "千紗みかん🍊🌌", "screen_name": "chisamikan", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2028783330871918592/EEbBjl3H.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/48926523/1772534614/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 180492, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "午前", "screen_name": "gzn_pp", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1809544487733264384/6xxzmurO.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/714439101525544960/1737302968/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "re